window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An explosive new science fantasy epic begins…</p> <p>Across the universe, a powerful group known as the Selected carry out the will of a mysterious cosmic entity known as the Prime, the voice of life. With its speech in their minds, they shape a future of peace, order, and universal expansion. But now, another voice is rising. The Other. A dark, seductive voice of death, whispers chaos. It corrupts the mind. And for those who listen… it can destroy everything. Visions of future death and destruction erupt in the mind of one man; Rogan Bass. Visions that are plagued in destruction, authoritarian rule, and a future soaked in blood. Are these visions prophecy… or manipulation?</p> <p>Driven by fear and duty, Rogan embarks on a desperate journey across the stars to uncover the truth. Meanwhile, on the central world of Taucury, political unrest brews. Governor Barion struggles to maintain control as a Dissident uprising threatens to tear the heart of the galactic order apart. Loyalties will be tested, powers will collide, and the very fabric of reality will begin to fray. With war looming and the voices of the Prime and the Other growing louder, Rogan must face not only the shadows beyond the stars... but the ones within himself.</p> <p><i>The Selected: Visions</i> is a gripping science fantasy thriller filled with pulse-pounding action, cosmic mystery, magical warfare, and political intrigue. It’s a story of destiny and deception, of terrifying knowledge and impossible choices. If you were cursed with the knowledge of future death and destruction…how far would you go to stop it?</p>"; 
